@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+# S083's re-landing on S292's and S293's guards, 2026-10-23: .tuning/coord/S083/reland2/bench.sh -- frozen copies of the
+# worktree's Release and tune builds (S083's weights, the queen re-anchored, on e972bd4: S292's and S293's guards) and
+# of the main checkout's Release build at e972bd4 (refused unless it benches 6042933; byte-different from
+# .ref-builds/ad0cfc7's, another build directory, same bench). bench and bench 12 on both; the tune build at its
